  - elementId: div-bottom
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [50, 498, 860, 1]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$ruleColor"
  - elementId: footer-nav
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 506, 860, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$gray"
      text: |
        <p>面向长上下文推理的稀疏注意力机制 · 博士学位论文答辩 <span style="float:right;">§4 核心方法 ｜ 05 / 10</span></p>
